{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"centralized-copy","entries":{"shoe-size-converter.copy.details":{"context":"shoe-size-converter UI copy.details","source_hash":"ed95f0c030255c698f5e993999ab9b00fc24ffe5abde57d880ed2b75038cf02f","translation":"Kifaa hubadilisha mm, cm au inchi kuwa milimita, hutumia miguu yako miwili mirefu zaidi na hupata urefu wa karibu katika chati unayoweka. Msaada wa toe huongezwa tu wakati ukurasa wa chati yako unaoelezea urefu wa ndani wa kiatu. Mondopoint inaonyeshwa kama urefu wa mita ya mita katika milimita; haibadilishwi kuwa mfumo mwingine."},"shoe-size-converter.copy.faq.2.a":{"context":"shoe-size-converter UI copy.faq.2.a","source_hash":"58accf86e23d299b259734d266850ead867d4867164e5ad96b0e6148daefc4cb","translation":"Hapana. Kiatu sura, upana, soksi na suala binafsi fit. Hii ni urefu kulinganisha, si sahihi dhamana; kufuata mwongozo wa mtengenezaji na kujaribu kiatu wakati inawezekana."},"shoe-size-converter.copy.faq.3.a":{"context":"shoe-size-converter UI copy.faq.3.a","source_hash":"fd44454f53f21f2738b6e79d77a2c0151718f9326496e120277598b33cb2ee37","translation":"Hapana. Ni maonyesho ya urefu wa mguu katika milimita. chombo hiki haina kuzalisha haki miliki ya msalaba-mfumo meza ubadilishaji."},"shoe-size-converter.copy.fields.allowance":{"context":"shoe-size-converter UI copy.fields.allowance","source_hash":"2e7861358fbd36d43760152efd1cfd8be3ec91aecef4e458ded7c7520a34ab63","translation":"Kupendekezwa toe ruzuku (mm)"},"shoe-size-converter.copy.fields.chartHelp":{"context":"shoe-size-converter UI copy.fields.chartHelp","source_hash":"b0c81ec8dc4a0834bed506b7dd8e0d86caf04a4977c99bf6d0236a0d8474d131","translation":"Paste 2 – 100 safu data, kama unataka na safu kichwa, moja kwa mstari: ukubwa label, urefu katika kitengo cha chati kuchaguliwa. Matumizi koma, alama ya nusu au tab. Mfano: Ukubwa 40; 258. Lengths lazima si kupungua kutoka ndogo kwa kubwa. Matumizi ya kikundi cha umri chati halisi na fit maelekezo."},"shoe-size-conve